# Line endings were never configured here, so every file kept whatever its author's
# editor produced: 125 of the 181 .mdx files were CRLF and 56 were LF. Any tool that
# rewrites a file whole then flips its terminators, which turns a one-line edit into a
# few-hundred-line diff and buries the real change. LF matches the other repos in this
# workspace (back/.gitattributes, and the .ts sources are LF throughout).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
